# Job: dotnet framework — shutdown consumes the first terminal of Draining publication; no timed wait or resubmit (F-R7-4)

You are a codex sub-agent under a Claude supervisor. Model gpt-6-astra, reasoning xhigh. Cap 2 h.
Read `AGENTS.md` (root) §2/§3/§4.1/§5, `framework/AGENTS.md`, `framework/languages/dotnet/AGENTS.md`. Campaign rules
(`doc/plan/c016-worklog/decisions.ko.md` D-098 item 4, D-101, D-105): no mitigations (no timeouts/retries/second
pollers/catch-alls), one owner per rule, regression test per fix, monotonic durations. Never modify `core/**`,
